@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DRAFT - Business Domain Model (not ERD)
hide methods
class Customer {
  fullName
  dateOfBirth
  optionalAddress
  optionalOccupation
  optionalContact
}
class VerifiedIdentityDocument {
  documentType
  documentNumber
  verificationEvidence
}
class Subscriber {
  activatedAt
}
class PhoneNumberInventory
class PhoneNumber {
  number
  availability
}
class ActivationRequest {
  callerApplication
  requestId
  canonicalContentFingerprint
  terminalAt
  resultRetentionUntil
  tombstoneSummary
  allocationMode
  waitConsent
  status
  waitingSince
  waitingDeadline
  outcome
}
class ServicePackage {
  name
  cyclePrice
  cycleDefinition
}
class PackageSubscription {
  cycleStart
  cycleEnd
  cancellationEffectiveAt
  appliedCyclePrice
  lifecycleState
}
class Account {
  accountKind
  balanceVND
  expiresAtOptional
  lifecycleState
}
class Transaction {
  direction
  amountVND
  businessRequest
  committedAt
  serviceOrPackageContext
}
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Subscriber : owns currently
Customer "1" -- "0..*" VerifiedIdentityDocument : verified links
PhoneNumberInventory "1" o-- "0..*" PhoneNumber
PhoneNumber "1" -- "0..1" Subscriber : current allocation
Subscriber "1" -- "1..*" Account
Account "1" -- "0..*" Transaction
Subscriber "1" -- "0..*" PackageSubscription
ServicePackage "1" -- "0..*" PackageSubscription
ActivationRequest "0..*" --> "0..1" Customer : resolved profile
ActivationRequest "1" --> "0..1" Subscriber : successful outcome
note bottom of ActivationRequest
  SUCCEEDED => exactly one Subscriber + main Account.
  WAITING => automatic empty pool + explicit consent;
  no successful Subscriber/Account yet; max 24h.
  Scope = caller + UC01 + requestId.\n  Same canonical content => at most one effect.\n  Full result 7 days after terminal; then tombstone.\n  WAITING FIFO priority; recovery every60s.
end note
note right of Transaction
  Consumption debit has service/package context;\n  registration fee refers to its subscription.\n  Physical mapping still deferred to detailed design.
end note
note right of PhoneNumber
  AVAILABLE / ASSIGNED are confirmed concepts.
  Reuse/quarantine lifecycle remains Open.
end note
note bottom of VerifiedIdentityDocument
  No automatic Customer merge.
  External verification evidence supplied by CSKH.\n  Linking another document to existing Customer\n  is outside UC01.
end note
@enduml
